{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 52,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Why do you boast of mischief, mighty man?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "勇士啊，你为何以作恶自夸？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "勇士啊，你為何以作惡自誇？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Your tongue plots destruction, like a sharp razor, working deceitfully.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你的舌头邪恶诡诈，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你的舌頭邪惡詭詐，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "You love evil more than good, than speaking the truth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你爱恶胜似爱善，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你愛惡勝似愛善，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "You love all devouring words, you deceitful tongue.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "诡诈的舌头啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "詭詐的舌頭啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "God will likewise destroy you forever. He will take you up, and pluck you out of your tent, and root you out of the land of the living. Selah.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神也要毁灭你，直到永远；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝也要毀滅你，直到永遠；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "The righteous also will see it, and fear, and laugh at him, saying,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "义人要看见而惧怕，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "義人要看見而懼怕，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "“Behold, this is the man who didn’t make God his strength, but trusted in the abundance of his riches, and strengthened himself in his wickedness.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "说：看哪，这就是那不以 神为他力量的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "說：看哪，這就是那不以上帝為他力量的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "But as for me, I am like a green olive tree in God’s house. I trust in God’s loving kindness forever and ever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "至于我，就像 神殿中的青橄榄树；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "至於我，就像上帝殿中的青橄欖樹；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will give you thanks forever, because you have done it. I will hope in your name, for it is good, in the presence of your saints.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要称谢你，直到永远，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要稱謝你，直到永遠，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}